  << /ActualText (The real mistake isn\047t \042wrong fonts\042 \204 it\047s two loud fonts in the same room\056 A quirky display font \053 another quirky display font \075 they\047re both fighting to be the main character\056\n\nThe fix\072 one loud\054 one quiet\056 A weird display font pairs fine with a plain\054 boring body font \204 that contrast is what makes it work\054 not \042matching styles\056\042)
